</div>

<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12">
            <h1 style="font-size:25px; font-weight:600;">VISION</h1>
            <p style="font-size:17px; line-height:32px; color:black;">
                To become a nationally recognized College of engineering and technological education that fosters innovation, interdisciplinary research, and societal impact. The institute aspires to nurture globally competent engineers equipped with cutting-edge skills in emerging technologies like Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Smart Systems and interdisciplinary engineering while upholding values of integrity, inclusiveness, and service to the nation.
            </p>
            <h1>MISSION</h1>
            <ol>
                <li>
                    Academic Excellence
                    To provide high-quality, future-ready engineering education in CSE, EE, ME, and CE through modern pedagogy, experiential learning, inspired mentorship and continuous curriculum innovation.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Foster Research and Innovation
                    To promote a culture of applied research and innovation with a strong focus on AI, healthcare technologies, sustainable development, and smart infrastructure.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Build Strategic Industry & Academic Linkages
                    To foster academic and industry collaborations that enhance research capabilities, entrepreneurship, and hands-on learning, ensuring graduates are future-ready.

                </li>
                <li>
                    Student-Centric Development
                    To cultivate a dynamic, inclusive, and value-driven learning environment that nurtures creativity, leadership, communication, and ethical responsibility among students.

                </li>
                <li>Societal Impact To actively contribute to regional progress and national missions through technology-driven solutions in agriculture, healthcare, education, and public infrastructure.</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>